  <GR_OpportunitySite_AbandonedLab.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==true)->We've intercepted radio transmissions from a seemingly abandoned genetics research lab not far from [map_definite]. The site may have some interesting ancient technology scattered around, so it could be a good idea to investigate it.\n\nWe should be well prepared, as genetic monstrosities may still be roaming the derelict installation.-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;我们截获了距离 [map_definite] 不远的一个看似废弃的遗传学研究实验室的无线电传输。该地点可能散布着一些有趣的古代技术，因此对其进行调查可能是个好主意。

我们应该做好充分准备，因为基因怪物可能仍在废弃的设施中游荡。</li>
  </GR_OpportunitySite_AbandonedLab.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
